  "description": "Command-line face of Bennewitz.Ninja.XamlQuality: audits an Avalonia, WPF or MAUI theme\n      for the resource keys it leaves undefined — the invisible-control cases — and for tokens\n      that fall below a contrast floor, and generates the compat dictionaries that close them.\n\n      Themes in, consumers in, findings out. All analysis lives in the\n      Bennewitz.Ninja.XamlQuality library; this project is argument parsing and reporting, so\n      the same rules are equally available from a test project without shelling out.",
